// Niuma Studio Windows resources. build.bat / release.yml compile
// this with windres (ships with the mingw-w64 gcc that cgo already
// requires) into rsrc_windows_amd64.syso next to main.go — go build
// auto-links any *_windows_amd64.syso in the package root, no extra
// linker flags anywhere.
//
// The .ico itself is regenerated from the brand PNGs by
// `go run ./tools/icongen -ico brand/icon-inverted.ico` right before
// windres runs, so brand/icon-inverted/ stays the single source of
// truth (same discipline as the macOS .icns path in build.sh).
//
// Two slots, one job each:
//   1      ICON  the standard slot: Explorer, shortcuts, and the
//               taskbar fallback all read the exe's first icon.
//   32512  ICON  the live window's slot: vendored webview registers
//               its window class with LoadImage(hInstance,
//               IDI_APPLICATION) — resource id 32512 — so this entry
//               is what the title bar / taskbar button of the running
//               app actually show. Harmless if webview ever changes.
1 ICON "brand/icon-inverted.ico"
32512 ICON "brand/icon-inverted.ico"
